# <type>(<scope>): <subject>

## Body (optional)

## Footer (optional)

---

## Type Categories
# build: Changes that affect the build system or external dependencies
# ci: Changes to CI configuration files and scripts
# docs: Documentation only changes
# feat: A new feature
# fix: A bug fix
# perf: A code change that improves performance
# refactor: Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
# style: Changes that do not affect the meaning of the code
# test: Adding missing tests or correcting existing tests

## Scope Examples
# theme: Color/spacing/font changes
# security: Security headers/rate-limiting/auth
# performance: Build optimization/bundle size/loading speed
# module-{name}: Specific business module changes

## Example Commits:
# fix(security): Add CSP frame-ancestors directive to prevent clickjacking
# perf(build): Implement Terser minification with console removal
# docs(phase-0): Complete performance baseline report
# feat(module-market): Add real-time WebSocket data streaming
